### Shared validation and request errors

form-has-errors = Please fix the errors in the form.
gig-attendance-invalid-motivation = That motivation is not valid.
gig-attendance-invalid-plan = That attendance response is not valid.
gig-edit-not-allowed = You are not allowed to edit this gig.
gig-edit-not-found = Gig not found.
gig-end-date-before-date = End date must be on or after date.
gig-end-time-before-call-time = End time must be at or after call time.
gig-end-time-before-set-time = End time must be at or after set time.
gig-rehearsal-leaders-same = Probeleitung 2 must be different from Probeleitung 1.
gig-set-time-before-call-time = Set time must be at or after call time.
# $field (String) - Localized label of the required field.
is-required = { $field } is required.
not-allowed = You are not allowed to do that.
not-found-title = Not found
